1b:T812,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HowTo","name":"F1 报税迟交怎么办？最新留学生【逾期报税自救指南】及补救流程","description":"不小心错过了 F1 报税截止日期？别慌！本指南详细讲解 F1 留学生报税迟交的自救步骤，包括 Form 8843 和 1040-NR 补交流程、潜在罚款解析，以及如何确保逾期申报不影响你的未来签证与身份申请。立即查看补救方案！","image":"https://www.mapleworld.online/og-image.png","totalTime":"PT1H","estimatedCost":{"@type":"MonetaryAmount","currency":"USD","value":"0"},"step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Step 1：评估你的情况","text":"确定你需要补交哪些表格：无收入 F1 学生只需提交 Form 8843，有收入 F1 学生需要提交 Form 1040-NR 和 Form 8843","url":"https://www.mapleworld.online/guides/f1-late-filing-guide#step1"},{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Step 2：准备补交材料","text":"收集所有必要的税务文件：W-2 表格、1099 表格、1042-S 表格、护照和 I-20 复印件、之前的报税记录","url":"https://www.mapleworld.online/guides/f1-late-filing-guide#step2"},{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Step 3：填写并提交表格","text":"Form 8843 在顶部标注 'Late Filing'，Form 1040-NR 如实填写所有收入，查看 IRS 官网获取最新的邮寄地址","url":"https://www.mapleworld.online/guides/f1-late-filing-guide#step3"},{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Step 4：支付欠税（如适用）","text":"通过 IRS Direct Pay 或 EFTPS 系统在线支付，或邮寄支票/汇票，如无法一次性支付可申请分期付款计划","url":"https://www.mapleworld.online/guides/f1-late-filing-guide#step4"},{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Step 5：跟进与记录","text":"保留邮寄凭证，等待 IRS 回复（通常需要 6-8 周），如有罚款通知及时响应并考虑申请罚款减免","url":"https://www.mapleworld.online/guides/f1-late-filing-guide#step5"}],"audience":{"@type":"Audience","audienceType":"F1留学生，错过报税截止日期需要补救的人群"}}13:["$","main",null,{"className":"pb-16 text-brand-ink","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1b"}}],["$","section",null,{"className":"px-4 py-8 sm:py-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-pink/10 to-transparent","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"page-shell","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl","children":[["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"mb-6","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Breadcrum